- `apps/coordinator-api/src/app/domain/trading.py` — `TradeRequest`/`TradeMatch`/`TradeNegotiation` status + created_at
- `apps/coordinator-api/src/app/domain/analytics.py` — `MarketMetric.recorded_at`, status+created_at on `MarketInsight`/`AnalyticsAlert`/`AnalyticsReport`/`DashboardConfig`/`DataCollectionJob`/`AlertRule`
